{"at":"2025-09-06","by":"human:mira","as":"house-policy","op":"policy","text":"We decide by consent: one reasoned objection stops a thing, and saying nothing is not an objection. Anything we cannot undo is not decided by silence.","rule":{"rule":"cautious","base":{"rule":"consent"}}}
